OL,3,GNEWSAElderly woman found dead named by
OL,4,Apolice
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elderly woman whose death sparked a
OL,7,Fmurder investigation has been named by
OL,8,Fpolice.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police (TVP) said Jill
OL,11,FGant, aged 88, was found dead at an
OL,12,Faddress on Appleford Drive in Abingdon,
OL,13,FOxfordshire at about 14:20 BST on
OL,14,FThursday afternoon.
OL,16,FHer family are being supported by
OL,17,Fspecially trained officers.
OL,19,FA 36-year-old man from Abingdon who was
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of murder remains
OL,21,Fin police custody.
